title: Session profile read-denies the whole Gnomon home; carve-backs by allow-list
summary: 'T-010 L3: instead of naming keys/kernel.db/sessions one by one, the session profile denies reading the whole Gnomon home and carves back only sessions/<own>, the exec''d bin/ copy and the runners/<tree> copy, each validated by realpath against HOME_READABLE_ROOTS (fail closed). SBPL last-match-wins: deny home, allow own, metadata on literal ancestors (realpath lstat needs it, measured EPERM without), re-deny keys + kernel log. Unix-socket connect to GNOMON_SOCK in the home is unaffected by file-read denies (measured).'
